###2026.06.08
- fix: re-compile par2cmdline backend with upstream patches
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.5.3
- changes: https://github.com/desertwitch/par2cron/releases/tag/v0.5.3
###2026.05.29
- fix: improve interrupt handling in cronjob
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.5.2
- changes: https://github.com/desertwitch/par2cron/releases/tag/v0.5.2
###2026.05.24b
- new: add last reported job progress to frontend
- fix: correct treatment for negative values in frontend
###2026.05.20
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.5.1
- changes: https://github.com/desertwitch/par2cron/releases/tag/v0.5.1
###2026.05.15a
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.5.0
- changes: https://github.com/desertwitch/par2cron/releases/tag/v0.5.0
###2026.05.10
- fix: refactor frontend log streaming logic (performance)
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.4.1
- changes: https://github.com/desertwitch/par2cron/releases/tag/v0.4.1
###2026.05.08
- fix: long running operations overflowing log filesystem
- fix: do not show operation buttons when array is not started
###2026.04.25
- new: bundle feature (produce one single file per PAR2 set)
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.4.0
- changes: https://github.com/desertwitch/par2cron/releases/tag/v0.4.0
###2026.04.13a
- fix: re-compile par2cmdline backend with important performance patch
