###2026.04.12
- new: allow sending notifications on completion of manual operations from GUI
- new: allow custom par2 binary in "/boot/config/plugins/dwpar2cron/custom" folder
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.3.2 (bugfix)
- changes: https://github.com/desertwitch/par2cron/releases/tag/v0.3.2
###2026.04.10d
- new: allow selection of shares to run par2cron against
- new: allow generation of diagnostic performance profiles
- new: added creation mode nested for growing media libraries
- new: added marker config option to allow persisting marker files
- fix: filesystem scanning performance significantly improved
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.3.1
- changes: https://github.com/desertwitch/par2cron/releases/tag/v0.3.1
- release note: thanks to forum user Karools for their feedback and testing
###2026.04.07d
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.2.2 (bugfix)
- changes: https://github.com/desertwitch/par2cron/releases/tag/v0.2.2
###2026.04.07
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.2.0
- changes: https://github.com/desertwitch/par2cron/releases/tag/v0.2.0
###2026.02.07
- new: par2cmdline backend was updated to release version 1.1.1
- changes: https://github.com/Parchive/par2cmdline/releases/tag/v1.1.1
###2026.02.03
- new: quick guide was updated to include new recursive mode
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.1.6
- changes: https://github.com/desertwitch/par2cron/releases/tag/v0.1.6
###2026.01.31
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.1.5
- changes: https://github.com/desertwitch/par2cron/releases/tag/v0.1.5
###2026.01.28
- new: par2cron backend was updated to release version 0.1.4
- new: quick guide was updated with more information about creation
###2026.01.27b
